concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 After subsection 23H(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (1A) To avoid doubt, the obligations imposed by subsection (1) do not limit and are not limited by any other obligations imposed, or rights conferred, by this section.  (1AB) If a representative of an Aboriginal legal assistance organisation is notified under subsection (1), the investigating official must not question the person until the earlier of the following times:  Obligations of investigating officials  Schedule 2  No. 75, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018  (a) the representative has communicated with the person;  (b) 2 hours have elapsed since the representative was notified." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (1A) To avoid doubt, the obligations imposed by subsection (1) do not limit and are not limited by any other obligations imposed, or rights conferred, by this section.  (1AB) If a representative of an Aboriginal legal assistance organisation is notified under subsection (1), the investigating official must not question the person until the earlier of the following times:  Obligations of investigating officials  Schedule 2  No. 75, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018  (a) the representative has communicated with the person;  (b) 2 hours have elapsed since the representative was notified."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6bbf17a0106ba186601407b1fb58371299285fb2e6b6e78064bd7a9d830b8490" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Representatives of Aboriginal legal assistance organisations must not question people until notified." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.8" ;
