doc:sch-3-sec-2-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "2(1) Subsection 15HK(1)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is, or has been, an entrusted person; and  (b) information came to the knowledge or into the possession of the person in the person’s capacity as an entrusted person; and  (c) the person discloses the information; and  (d) the information relates to a controlled operation. Note: Recklessness is the fault element for paragraphs (1)(b) and (d)—see section 5.6 of the Criminal Code. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years." ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

