concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-86b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86B Simplified outline of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-86b ;
    values:originalText "This Part authorises collection, use and disclosure of personal information for preventing, detecting, investigating or dealing with:  Schedule 7  Personal information that may be relevant for integrity purposes  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 75, 2018  (a) serious misconduct by persons working for Commonwealth bodies; or  (b) fraud affecting Commonwealth bodies; or  (c) offences against Chapter 7 of the Criminal Code (which is about the proper administration of Government). The authorisation is relevant to laws (such as privacy laws) that limit the collection, use and disclosure of personal information unless authorised by law." ;
    skos:definition "This Part authorises collection, use and disclosure of personal information for preventing, detecting, investigating or dealing with:  Schedule 7  Personal information that may be relevant for integrity purposes  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 75, 2018  (a) serious misconduct by persons working for Commonwealth bodies; or  (b) fraud affecting Commonwealth bodies; or  (c) offences against Chapter 7 of the Criminal Code (which is about the proper administration of Government). The authorisation is relevant to laws (such as privacy laws) that limit the collection, use and disclosure of personal information unless authorised by law."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "739c64bc7d3143f208b955757a1f4005f7eb70430e725ea2f0597a06ad000480" ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authorization for collection, use and disclosure of personal information for integrity purposes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
