concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-86c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86C Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-86c ;
    values:originalText "purpose  A target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive information that:  (a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably necessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the entity’s functions or activities; or  (b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth company—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the entity’s functions or activities. Note: Subclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the circumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive information. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive information for an integrity purpose in circumstances corresponding to those in which it may collect other personal information (see subclauses 3.1 and 3.2 of that Principle)." ;
    skos:definition "purpose  A target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive information that:  (a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably necessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the entity’s functions or activities; or  (b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth company—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the entity’s functions or activities. Note: Subclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the circumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive information. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive information for an integrity purpose in circumstances corresponding to those in which it may collect other personal information (see subclauses 3.1 and 3.2 of that Principle)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7e45b08db42055a0a8dcd11af54794f67f34d75510d055c1f77201ecaa360adb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity purposes." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
