doc:sch-7-sec-86e-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "86E(1) Disclosure of personal information to target entity for integrity" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a law of the Commonwealth or of a State or Territory:  Personal information that may be relevant for integrity purposes  Schedule 7  No. 75, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018  (a) limits disclosure of some or all personal information by a person, body or authority (however described); and  (b) exempts from the limitation a disclosure authorised by a law of the Commonwealth. Note: Australian Privacy Principle 6 is an example of such a law of the Commonwealth. The Principle prohibits an APP entity from disclosing personal information for a purpose other than the one for which the entity collected the information, unless the disclosure is authorised under an Australian law or certain other exceptions apply." ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-86e-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "86E(2) Disclosure of personal information to target entity for integrity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-86e-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of the exemption, the person, body or authority may disclose to a target entity for an integrity purpose personal information that the person, body or authority reasonably believes is related to one or more of the target entity’s functions or activities. Limit on subsection (2) for disclosures by target entity" ;
    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of the exemption, the person, body or authority may disclose to a target entity for an integrity purpose personal information that the person, body or authority reasonably believes is related to one or more of the target entity’s functions or activities. Limit on subsection (2) for disclosures by target entity"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "643dbc33f525daec97a2d46da373e4dd864e4bd6c6e70a0c4f6f8d8108d6b4a1" ;
