    skos:prefLabel "86G Guidelines on the operation of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-86g ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary of the Department may publish guidelines approved by the Information Commissioner on the operation of this Part.  Schedule 7  Personal information that may be relevant for integrity purposes  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 75, 2018  (2) Guidelines under subsection (1) are not a legislative instrument." ;
