concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 86C of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the collection of sensitive information on and after the commencement of that section. (2) Section 86D of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the use of personal information by a target entity on or after the commencement of that section, whether the entity collected the information before, on or after that commencement. (3) Section 86E of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the disclosure of personal information on or after the commencement of that section, whether the person, body or authority making the disclosure collected the information before, on or after that commencement.  Exemptions to spent convictions scheme  Schedule 8  No. 75, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 86C of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the collection of sensitive information on and after the commencement of that section. (2) Section 86D of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the use of personal information by a target entity on or after the commencement of that section, whether the entity collected the information before, on or after that commencement. (3) Section 86E of the Crimes Act 1914 applies to the disclosure of personal information on or after the commencement of that section, whether the person, body or authority making the disclosure collected the information before, on or after that commencement.  Exemptions to spent convictions scheme  Schedule 8  No. 75, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Powers, Offences and Other Measures) Act 2018"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2a20301cfffd3d4a936ced0e3b5aadae8c7b648479b1883dd917fa663a965e9a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Applicability of sections 86C, 86D, and 86E of the Crimes Act 1914" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-offences-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
